VERSION 1.1
Date: 2026-05-16
Status: Released

Changelog:
- Improved heuristic filters: skip category/list/tag pages, shallow paths, single-numeric-segment URLs, navigation titles
- Removed inline style/class/presentation attributes from chapter HTML to fix EPUB reader font scaling
- Persisted completed task metadata to disk so downloads survive server restarts
- Added URL pattern filter support for catalog parsing
- Fixed chapter order sorting after parallel fetch
- Auto-detect URL pattern from catalog preview and auto-fill input field
- Changed download to use fetch+blob with Save As dialog instead of direct link
